<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">

	<PropertyGroup>
		<TargetFramework>net8.0</TargetFramework>
		<ImplicitUsings>enable</ImplicitUsings>
		<Nullable>enable</Nullable>
		<RootNamespace>CJF.NamedPipe</RootNamespace>
		<GenerateDocumentationFile>True</GenerateDocumentationFile>
		<Title>$(AssemblyName)</Title>
		<AssemblyName>CJF.NamedPipe</AssemblyName>
		<Description>NamedPipe Services</Description>
		<Copyright>Copyright(c) 2025 Chen Jaofeng all right reserved.</Copyright>
		<Version>1.02.60</Version>
		<Authors>Chen Jaofeng</Authors>
		<Company>Chen Jaofeng</Company>
		<PackageReadmeFile>readme.md</PackageReadmeFile>
		<PackageTags>Utility;NamedPipe;Extensions</PackageTags>
		<PackageReleaseNotes>
v1.02.60 (2025-11-28)
- ✅ **新增心跳機制**: 伺服端定期發送心跳訊息給客戶端，提早偵測斷線狀況
- ✅ **新增 StreamMessageTypes.Heartbeat**: 新增心跳訊息類型
- ✅ **新增 PipeLineOptions.HeartbeatIntervalMs**: 可配置心跳間隔時間（預設 30 秒），設為 0 或負數可停用
- 🔧 **客戶端自動忽略心跳**: PipeClient 自動忽略心跳訊息，不傳遞給使用者處理器
- 🔧 **改善錯誤處理**: 在串流寫入和回應發送過程中，增加對 IOException 的捕獲，並記錄客戶端連接中斷的調試訊息
- 🔧 **優化同步寫入**: 使用 SemaphoreSlim 實現串流寫入的同步，防止多執行緒寫入導致資料交錯
		</PackageReleaseNotes>
		<PackageLicenseExpression>MIT</PackageLicenseExpression>
		<GeneratePackageOnBuild>True</GeneratePackageOnBuild>
	</PropertyGroup>
	<PropertyGroup>
		<PackageReadmeFile>readme.md</PackageReadmeFile>
		<Description>NamedPipe Services</Description>
		<PackageProjectUrl>https://github.com/Jaofeng/NamedPipe</PackageProjectUrl>
		<RepositoryUrl>https://github.com/Jaofeng/NamedPipe</RepositoryUrl>
	</PropertyGroup>
	<ItemGroup>
		<None Update="readme.md">
			<PackagePath>\</PackagePath>
			<Pack>True</Pack>
		</None>
	</ItemGroup>
	<ItemGroup>
		<PackageReference Include="Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection" Version="9.0.7" />
		<PackageReference Include="Microsoft.Extensions.Hosting" Version="9.0.7" />
		<PackageReference Include="Microsoft.Extensions.Logging" Version="9.0.7" />
		<PackageReference Include="Microsoft.Extensions.Options" Version="9.0.7" />
		<PackageReference Include="Microsoft.Extensions.Options.ConfigurationExtensions"
			Version="9.0.7" />
		<PackageReference Include="System.IO.Pipes" Version="4.3.0" />
	</ItemGroup>
</Project>